  "reading": "At load 4.4-6.8 the HEAD suite reads 53.9-59.3 s (median 56.5 s, n=6), against 53.58 s for hv-umm2.460 at load 3.8-5.2. The 70.75 s reading at load 18.6-22.9 is host load, not a regression."
